3
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:20,269
A group of corporations concerned about the problems

4
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:20,269
一群担心千年虫计算机危机的公司

5
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:23,543
已经召集会议…
related to the Y2K computer bug have convened...

6
00:01:26,386 --> 00:01:30,220
1999年2月20日

7
00:02:57,343 --> 00:02:58,708
乖，不要哭
No. Dont cry.

8
00:02:59,946 --> 00:03:02,710
别哭，嘿
Dont cry. Hey.

9
00:03:03,950 --> 00:03:05,542
没事了
Everythings gonna be okay.

10
00:03:07,987 --> 00:03:11,684
嗨，没事了
Hi. Everythings gonna be okay, pal.

11
00:03:13,193 --> 00:03:15,684
来，对
Come here, come here. Yeah.

12
00:03:16,462 --> 00:03:19,192
乖宝宝，好，不哭了
Thats a good boy. Okay, dont cry.

13
00:03:22,635 --> 00:03:24,660
她不会再伤害你了
She cant hurt you anymore.

14
00:03:25,672 --> 00:03:32,601
都结束了，来 没有人能够再伤害你了
Its over. Come here. No ones gonna hurt you ever again.

15
00:03:42,922 --> 00:03:46,050
乔的酒吧 成立于1948年

16
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:48,024
2011年4月17日

17
00:03:52,899 --> 00:03:56,733
我是刘易斯希克斯 我是个采访记者
My name is Louis Hicks. Im an investigative reporter.

18
00:03:57,503 --> 00:04:00,028
专门采访杀人犯及罪犯的故事
I cover stories of killers and criminals.

19
00:04:02,275 --> 00:04:04,641
他们的人生是黑暗 毫无希望的
Their lives are dark, without hope.

20
00:04:05,945 --> 00:04:09,779
我试着不受其影响，但很难
I try not to let it affect me, but its hard.

21
00:04:14,153 --> 00:04:18,283
一嘿！高登！暍两杯 一不行！
-Hey! Gordo! Two shots. -No!

22
00:04:18,391 --> 00:04:19,585
一好啦 一不行、不行
-Yes, yes. -No, no, no, no.

23
00:04:19,692 --> 00:04:21,091
一我一小时后上班 －一杯
-I got to work in an hour. -Just one, just one.

24
00:04:21,194 --> 00:04:22,786
一不行 －一杯，传统方式
-No, no. -One shot, old-school.

25
00:04:22,895 --> 00:04:24,419
一杯，就一杯 一好啦
-One. One shot. -There it is.

26
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,701
一敬刘易斯 一对
-To Louis. -Yeah.

27
00:04:39,579 --> 00:04:41,672
好，现在你请了我 换我请你吃早餐
All right, now you do something for me. Let me buy you breakfast.

28
00:04:41,781 --> 00:04:45,342
太晚了，我已经吃过了 冠军的早餐
Too late. I already ate. Breakfast of champions.

29
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:53,122
工作还好吗？有任何令人注目 我该知道的真人实事吗？
Hows work? Any compelling real-life stories I should know about?

30
00:04:53,493 --> 00:04:54,824
今天没有
Not today.

31
00:04:56,029 --> 00:04:57,018
男砖
Well

32
00:04:57,297 --> 00:04:58,889
你呢？ 在写书了吗？
Hows work for you, huh? You working on the book?

33
00:04:58,998 --> 00:05:01,762
一直都在写啊，高登
Always. Always working, Gordo.
